[00:08.20]1. Come with rejoicing, and learn about Jehovah.
[00:15.32]“Come drink life’s water,” the spirit has said.
[00:22.70]Healthful instruction, God has provided.
[00:29.90]All those who hunger for truth will be fed.
[00:35.54]2. Never forsaking our gathering together,
[00:49.60]We must be taught; we must learn what is right.
[00:56.84]Here with God’s spirit, here with our brothers,
[01:03.58]Here we are strengthened to walk in the light.
[01:11.20]3. Lips that sing praise, how encouraging to hear them!
[01:36.30]Tongues of the taught ones, how sweet is their sound!
[01:44.76]Oh, may we always meet with God’s people!
[01:51.98]Oh, may we always among them be found!
